cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use SpectralBridge in research, please cite the software release you used."
title: "SpectralBridge: Translating reflectance across sensors and scales"
type: software
version: "2.2.0"
abstract: "SpectralBridge is a scientific Python package for translating reflectance across sensors and scales with restart-safe, file-based workflows."
